    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hemera&quot; is a little narrative game blending exploration, symbolic combat, and impactful choices. Immersed in a mysterious forest, you will discover a world where reality and mystery intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a captivating art direction and an immersive soundtrack, &quot;Hemera&quot; invites you to an experience where every detail tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/c997e84c4908c69f296cfddb2c4ab224.poster.avif?t=1751548548\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/c997e84c4908c69f296cfddb2c4ab224.webm?t=1751548548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/c997e84c4908c69f296cfddb2c4ab224.mp4?t=1751548548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative</strong> \u2013 Experience an emotional story told through dialogues, art, and a retro atmosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person exploration</strong> \u2013 Interact with your environment and discover the story at your own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/351077d2c9c12dae0477b7dc8d331e30.poster.avif?t=1751548548\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/351077d2c9c12dae0477b7dc8d331e30.webm?t=1751548548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/351077d2c9c12dae0477b7dc8d331e30.mp4?t=1751548548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warm graphics.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short</strong> \u2013 Designed to be finished in roughly one hour. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/2f14963468409cf702c2975f5c7171b4.poster.avif?t=1751548548\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/2f14963468409cf702c2975f5c7171b4.webm?t=1751548548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499160/extras/2f14963468409cf702c2975f5c7171b4.mp4?t=1751548548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(GAME LENGTH: 50\u201370 minutes)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE USE HEADPHONES FOR THE BEST EXPERIENCE.</strong></p>",
